cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Closing Guard (打烊): a local-first closing-safety agent with MiniCPM"
abstract: >-
  A local-first agent that turns old Android phones into closing-safety
  terminals, using MiniCPM-V 4.7 1B for semantic checks, MiniCPM-OCR 1.0 for
  meter readings, and a hash-chained evidence ledger.
